      "comment": "ILOVETHISTOWN (4) ended his last season with a pair of modest runs on the poly at Devonport and will be resuming on his more favoured turf surface with a couple of strong trial efforts under his belt. He benefits from a 1.5kg claim and should be ready to rumble fresh. BAYBOUGG (5) ran on late last time out and was hitting the line fresh up here before that. She has been a winner third up in the past, and will have Craig Newitt in the saddle here, so expect her to be positive out of the gate. Each way claims. POPILITA (3) stepped up in class and finished third by less than 2 lengths when trying to make all the running here 9 days ago. She is likely to try similar tactics from a handy gate and is an each-way chance again. FURNEAUX (1) is a quality gelding resuming from a spell, and he has yet to miss a cheque in 5 starts fresh up in the past, including 2 wins. A 4kg claim will help ease his 64.5kg impost, and he must be kept safe in all combos. GOLDEN MEADOW (2) won't be far away.",
